ls/52648","html_url":"https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/52648","diff_url":"https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/52648.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/52648.patch","merged_at":"2026-10-09T17:16:13Z"},"body":"Limit daemon feature compatibility checks to explicit CLI overrides\n\n## Why\n\nA running shared background server owns its feature settings until it restarts. Differences from a client's configuration files or defaults should not trigger a compatibility warning or a restart request.\n\n## What changed\n\n- Check shared-service features only when explicitly overridden on the command line.\n- Exclude overrides superseded by active legacy managed configuration or feature requirements, while supporting older servers without `configRequirements/read`.\n- Pass only the remaining explicit feature overrides to a requested daemon restart.\n\n## Testing\n\nUpdate compatibility tests for stale daemon overrides, explicit enable/disable requests, managed configuration, and older servers. Extend CLI startup tests to verify the feature overrides persisted after a restart.\n\n<!-- copyberry-projection-id: 70872841a5483578cc4c6099340ef8132486e31e688a9b4aa6595ae50fbfd618 -->","closed_by":{"login":"copyberry[bot]","id":240088373,"node_id":"BOT_kgDODk91NQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/2173631?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/copyberry%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/copyberry","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copyberry%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copyberry%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copyberry%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copyberry%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copyberry%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copyberry%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.co